from_strh reads the map fixture's .strh twin, dropping the LID in front of
every line, and the reader verbs read the result. to_strh draws the column
again: with the same seeds and number, document 1, the text comes back byte
for byte, and as document 0, the header's, it carries the LIDs of ADR.9's
vector. The calls end with what is refused: a SILT file handed to
from_strh, seeds and numbers out of range, and a value that is not an int.
